factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The reel_script and tamil_headline say the 275-worker gift was given in Kinathukadavu union, but the article says the gift was distributed in Kinathukadavu union and also in Pothanur (Coimbatore corporation south zone) with 509 workers; the 275 figure covers only the Kinathukadavu event, so the headline's framing is partly inaccurate.
  The reel_script and slides_spec attribute the gift to 'அமைச்சர் விக்னேஷ்' as the one who gave it, but the article names him as the minister of the prohibition department (மதுவிலக்கு துறை அமைச்சர்); the draft omits this department, which is an important detail of who gave the gift.
  The reel_script states the 25 T.V.K. union workers received the gift as a separate group inside the 275 total, but the reel_script's sentence about 250 workers 'இதில் பயன் பெற்றனர்' and the 25 workers is presented as an additional statement, mixing the 250 and 25 groups without clarifying they sum to 275.
  The caption says the 275 total is 'மொத்தம் 275' while the caption's first line attributes '275 தூய்மை பணியாளர்களுக்கு' to Kinathukadavu only, mixing the Pothanur 509 event into the same narrative sentence about the total without clear separation.
  The slides_spec 'எத்தனை பேர்?' slide lists 250 and 25 and total 275 but the second slide's header 'மொத்தம் 275 பேருக்கு பரிசு' is placed after separate lines, while the third slide's 'போத்தனூரில் 509' is a different event not clearly linked to the headline number, mixing two facts.
  The tamil_headline 'கிணத்துக்கடவு ஒன்றியத்தில் 275 தூய்மை பணியாளர்களுக்கு' mixes the Kinathukadavu event with the 509 Pothanur event implicitly, and the Pothanur event's 'மாநகராட்சி தெற்கு மண்டலம்' location is not stated in the reel_script's wording as a separate corporation event.
