factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  Draft says the Tirunelveli-area parent complaint was filed on 'அக்டோபர் 5' (October 5); the article only says 'கடந்த 5ம் தேதி' (the 5th of an unstated month), so the month is an invented detail.
  The reel_script and caption/slides say the Coimbatore engineer's accused status and arrest were in Vasudevanallur, but the article's arrest was by Tenkasi all-women police; the caption says 'தென்காசி அனைத்து மகளிர் போலீசார்' for the investigation, which matches, but the headline and slide 1 frame the engineer as 'கோவை மாநகராட்சி இன்ஜினியர்' in Vasudevanallur, consistent with the article, so no change there.
  The reel_script states the Coimbatore engineer was arrested on the day before yesterday ('நேற்று முன்தினம்') and the headmaster arrested 'நேற்று' (yesterday), which the article gives only as 'நேற்று' for the headmaster and 'நேற்று முன்தினம்' for the engineer; this matches, so not a problem.
  The reel_script's first sentence says the engineer 'சிறுமிக்கு பாலியல் தொல்லை கொடுத்ததாக கைது செய்யப்பட்டார்' without the place; the place is given later, which is acceptable.
